WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Saved filters. Save a query like “today & p1 & #Launch” and reopen its tasks from the sidebar.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: hot list; someday.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Write a query → Checked as you type → Saved to your sidebar

4
00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:17.420
Name a filter…

5
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:21.570
…and write a query. It's checked as you type.

6
00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:23.170
Save it.

7
00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:27.170
The filter lists matching open tasks, and sits in your sidebar.

8
00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:33.170
“The query ends too early”: An operator is missing its right-hand side, e.g. a trailing `&`. “No tag called …”: Check the spelling, or create the tag first.

9
00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:37.670
A readable query language
